we keep track of the size separately because we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.680
might want to store a number of bits&nbsp;
bits that's not a multiple of eight

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:03.920
so the array might be a few&nbsp;
