00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:27.880
then we count false positives by querying an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:30.240
equal number of strings that&nbsp;
were not added to the filter

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:35.200
and compare with the estimated false positive&nbsp;
rate based off our mathematical analysis

